[00:00.000] 作词 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:24.364] Far, far away
[00:27.661] Though we never saw it coming
[00:32.146] It rained down from the sky
[00:35.691] Translucent, it whirled in multi-colored light
[00:40.401]
[00:41.315] I stood so still
[00:44.776] Like a stone who's long been yearning
[00:49.354] And I learned how to fly
[00:52.813] The captain employed me as he felt inclined
[00:57.625]
[00:58.293] Then I started to wonder
[01:02.453] As galaxies passed us by
[01:06.466] For what purpose did he leave home
[01:10.528] And did he miss his life?
[01:14.295] He said, "To be honest, his purpose on earth
[01:18.354] He never could find"
[01:22.246]
[01:22.896] All through the years
[01:26.151] I thought of him as my brother
[01:30.624] And he told me that I
[01:34.224] Reminded him of himself as a child
[01:39.017]
[01:39.757] We had it all
[01:43.274] The universe was our mother
[01:47.552] She guides us where she decides
[01:51.331] And she wants us to dwell in peace tonight
[01:56.340]
[01:56.910] Free from the bow of the hunter
[02:00.936] Healed by the light in her eyes
[02:04.952] That profound love I was shown
[02:08.984] Forever changed my life
[02:12.784] I knew in my heart that my purpose on earth
[02:16.797] Was one I could find
[02:20.492]
[02:21.315] World of spinning blue
[02:24.927] I now come back to you
[02:28.721] And the love that I was given
[02:32.616] Is the love I'll show to you
